cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the archived release and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "Matched-exposure coseismic landslide transfer benchmark"
abstract: >-
  Experiment code, frozen data manifests and splits, machine-readable metrics,
  bootstrap and interval routines, and audit reports for a retrospective,
  region-held-out benchmark of coseismic landslide segmentation under
  cross-event domain shift, including the four-backbone matched-exposure
  contrast.
